          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div><br></div><div>VertiAid™ is a dietary supplement marketed to support inner ear wellness, balance, coordination, and overall daily well-being. It is designed for adults who want to maintain their body's natural balance system and support their everyday activities as part of a healthy lifestyle. The product is promoted as a convenient addition to a daily wellness routine for people interested in supporting balance and stability.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>VertiAid™ is formulated with a combination of vitamins, minerals, and other nutritional ingredients. Depending on the product formulation, these may include Vitamin D3, Vitamin B6, zinc, marine collagen, eggshell collagen, and selected botanical ingredients. Each ingredient serves a different nutritional purpose, helping contribute to general wellness rather than providing a guaranteed result for a specific condition.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>One of the main reasons VertiAid™ attracts attention is its focus on the relationship between nutritional support and the body's balance system. Balance involves several body systems working together, including the inner ear, eyes, brain, and nerves. Maintaining good overall health, following a balanced diet, staying hydrated, and getting sufficient rest can all contribute to general well-being.</div><div><br></div><div>VertiAid™ is intended to complement these healthy habits, not replace them. Although the product may be marketed for people concerned about dizziness or balance difficulties, there is not enough reliable clinical evidence to conclude that VertiAid™ itself can prevent or treat vertigo, dizziness, or inner ear disorders. Individual experiences can differ, and results should not be guaranteed.</div><br><div>For anyone considering VertiAid™, it is important to review the complete ingredient label, follow the manufacturer's directions, and consider possible allergies or interactions with medications. People who experience persistent dizziness, repeated balance problems, or sudden severe symptoms should seek medical attention to determine the underlying cause.</div><div><br></div><div>Overall, VertiAid™ is positioned as a nutritional supplement for adults interested in supporting everyday wellness and balance-related health. It is best considered as a possible complement to healthy lifestyle habits rather than a substitute for professional medical evaluation or treatment.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
