        {
          "_name": "header3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header3\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Align\" name=\"contentAlign\">\n            <option value>Left</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-center\" selected>Center</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-end\">Right</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background11.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#393193\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"align-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row {{contentAlign}}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Building a website</b></h1>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showSubitle\"><b>FAQs Of VertiAid ?</b></h2>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">For fast prototyping and small customers' projects.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-success\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Free Download!</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_anchor": "header3-19",
          "_cid": "uSAZF0QlCi",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "list2",
          "_sourceTheme": "tutorm5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 32px",
                "margin": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 20px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "0 4px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "margin": "0",
              ".title-wrapper": {
                ".mbr-section-title": {
                  "margin-bottom": "50px",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "margin-bottom": "32px"
                  }
                }
              },
              ".panel-group": {
                ".card": {
                  "border-bottom": "1px solid @border",
                  "border-radius": "0 !important",
                  "&:first-child": {
                    "border-top": "1px solid @border"
                  },
                  ".card-header": {
                    "padding": "32px 0",
                    "border-bottom": "none",
                    "background-color": "transparent",
                    ".panel-title": {
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "space-between",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "&:not(.collapsed)": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "transform": "rotate(-45deg)"
                        }
                      },
                      ".panel-title-edit": {
                        "margin-bottom": "0"
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "24px",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-out"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  ".panel-collapse": {
                    ".panel-body": {
                      "margin-bottom": "50px",
                      "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                        "margin-bottom": "32px"
                      },
                      ".mbr-text": {
                        "margin-bottom": "50px",
                        "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                          "margin-bottom": "32px"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 list2\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<header>Items</header>\n\t\t<select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#838383\" name=\"border\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFAQ\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What Is VertiAid™ and What Is It Designed For?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">VertiAid™ is presented as a wellness product marketed for people interested in supporting their everyday well-being. If the product is intended to address dizziness or balance-related concerns, it is important to understand its actual formulation and the evidence behind its claims. Balance depends on several systems in the body, including the inner ear, vision, and sensory pathways. The causes of dizziness can vary, so a supplement should not be assumed to treat every underlying cause. Review the manufacturer's official product information to understand the intended use, confirmed ingredients, and recommended directions before deciding whether VertiAid™ is appropriate for you.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>How Should I Take VertiAid™?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">VertiAid™ should be used according to the instructions on its official packaging. Check the recommended serving size, directions for use, ingredient list, and any warnings provided by the manufacturer. Do not take more than the recommended amount in an attempt to obtain faster results. If you take prescription medications, have an existing medical condition, or experience recurring dizziness, consult a qualified healthcare professional before using a supplement. A healthcare professional can help determine whether a supplement is appropriate and whether further assessment is needed.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>How Long Does VertiAid™ Take to Work?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">The time it takes to notice an effect depends on the product's actual ingredients, the reason for using it, and individual health circumstances. There is no verified timeline available here for VertiAid™. Claims that it will relieve dizziness or improve balance within a specific number of days should not be treated as established facts without reliable supporting evidence. If dizziness persists, becomes more frequent, or interferes with everyday activities, seek medical advice rather than relying on a supplement alone.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Is VertiAid™ Suitable for Everyone?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">VertiAid™ may not be suitable for everyone. Safety depends on the actual ingredients, dosage, possible interactions, and individual health circumstances. People who are pregnant or breastfeeding, those with existing medical conditions, and individuals taking medications should consult a healthcare professional before starting a new supplement. It is also important to review the product label for allergens and other warnings. If you experience an adverse reaction after taking a supplement, stop using it and seek appropriate medical advice.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Is BurnBlend™ safe for everyone?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Dietary supplements may not be suitable for everyone. Anyone who is pregnant or breastfeeding, has an existing medical condition, or takes prescription or over-the-counter medications should consult a qualified healthcare professional before using BurnBlend™. It is also important to review the complete ingredient list and follow the product's recommended serving instructions. If an unexpected reaction occurs, discontinue use and seek appropriate medical advice.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "list2-10",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "uSyixu0mvQ",
