            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 list2\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, mobirise-icons\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<header>Items</header>\n\t\t<select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\">4</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"5\">5</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#838383\" name=\"border\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFAQ\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Can VertiAid™ Replace Medical Treatment for Vertigo or Dizziness?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">No. VertiAid™ should not replace a medical evaluation or prescribed treatment for vertigo or dizziness. These symptoms can arise from different causes, including inner-ear disorders, medication effects, dehydration, and other health conditions. Appropriate treatment depends on identifying the underlying cause. If dizziness occurs alongside sudden weakness, difficulty speaking, severe headache, chest pain, fainting, or difficulty walking, seek emergency medical care. For recurring or unexplained symptoms, arrange an assessment with a qualified healthcare professional.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Is Audifort™ Worth Considering for Hearing Health?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Audifort™ may interest adults looking for a supplement marketed for general hearing wellness, but its value depends on the verified formula, product quality, price, and available scientific evidence. Consumers should avoid relying solely on promotional claims or testimonials when evaluating a supplement. A balanced diet, protection from excessive noise, and appropriate hearing evaluations are important parts of caring for hearing health. If you experience persistent ringing, difficulty understanding speech, ear pain, or changes in hearing, consult a healthcare professional. Sudden hearing loss requires urgent assessment. Audifort™ should be considered a supplement, not a replacement for proven medical care.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>Can I take BurnBlend™ with other supplements or medications?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Because the exact formulation and ingredients can vary, it is important to check the current product label before combining BurnBlend™ with other supplements. If you take prescription medication, have a medical condition, or are unsure about potential ingredient interactions, speak with your doctor or pharmacist before use. Do not change or stop prescribed medication based on information about a dietary supplement.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What is the best way to take CogniCare Pro?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Just take 1 capsule every day before a meal with a half glass of water and you will love the results and see how you will feel.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"cardAmount > 4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"panel-title-edit mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".panel-title-edit, .mbr-iconfont\"><b>What if CogniCare Pro doesn't work for me?</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-plus mobi-mbri\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">I demand you are enthusiastic with your purchase, not just satisfied. And you won't know until you try it! So you can use CogniCare Pro for 90 days, with my \"No Questions Asked 100% Money Back Guarantee\". The only way to be totally convinced is to try this amazing formula and experience the results for yourself.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
